            On Feb 14, 2023 this sequence version replaced NC_004680.1.
            Genome sequencing performed by the Pittsburgh Bacteriophage
            Institute by Illumina sequencing. Coverage is 852x with no Sanger
            finishing reactions required.  Assembled using Newbler and Consed,
            October 18, 2022,  This is a re-sequencing of Che8, found in 2002.
            
